- `pnpm --dir apps/web test src/duos/DuosReplay.test.tsx src/replay/ReplayPlayer.test.tsx` (its `pretest` builds the wasm)
- `pnpm --dir apps/web exec vitest run src/replay/opening.test.tsx src/replay/ShareGif.test.tsx src/routes/replays.test.tsx src/routes/practice.test.tsx src/routes/match.test.tsx src/duos/DuosBoard.test.tsx src/i18n/i18n.test.ts`
- `pnpm --dir apps/web typecheck`
- `pnpm exec eslint apps/web e2e`
- `pnpm --dir apps/web test`

